@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Server -> 200, status running
GET {{host}}/

### 2. Danh sach bai tap -> 200, co bai 1 dang mo
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. Tao luot nop -> 201, Location, status received, updatedAt
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"SV001","repositoryUrl":"https://example.com/sv001/signalr"}

### 4. Chay ca 3 truoc; bam lai sau 1s va 3s -> 200 received/processing/graded
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Thieu du lieu -> 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"","repositoryUrl":""}

### 6. Bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"SV001","repositoryUrl":"https://example.com/sv001/signalr"}

### 7. Guid rong -> 404 SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Bat tay hub -> 200, connectionId va 3 availableTransports
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Sai duong dan hub -> 404
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 10. Bai da dong -> 400 ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"SV001","repositoryUrl":"https://example.com/sv001/signalr"}

### 11. Thieu repositoryUrl -> 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"SV001"}

### 12. JSON hong -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":

### 13. Sai Content-Type -> 415
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

studentCode=SV001&repositoryUrl=https://example.com/repo

### 14. Bai tap chi tiet -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/assignments/1

### 15. Bai tap chi tiet khong ton tai -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/assignments/999

### 16. Bai tap 2: van nhan 201 received, sau 3s thanh failed
# @name failedSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"SV002","repositoryUrl":"http://example.com/sv002/signalr"}

### 17. Chay ca 16 truoc, doi 3s -> 200, status failed
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{failedSubmission.response.body.$.id}}
